nDermatology\nEmergency Medicine\nIntegrative Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nMedical Oncology\nRadiology\nRehabilitation\nSurgery\nUrgent Care\nPrevious Slide\nNext Slide\nComprehensive and Compassionate Care for New Orleans Pets Every Day of the Year\nMedVet New Orleans is home to the most advanced 24-hour emergency, critical care, and specialty pet care in the area and is the only emergency animal hospital in New Orleans to offer\ninternal medicine\n. Our comprehensive care is an extension of your family veterinarian.\nAs part of our advanced veterinary care, we offer life-saving treatments for your pets.\nServing thousands of patients a year, our team is a trusted partner in care for family veterinarians and pet lovers. We know pets are an important part of your family, and we strive to provide exceptional care while showing compassion for you and your pet. Our team has the expertise and the resources in our state-of-the-art facility to diagnose and treat your pet, giving them the best chance for a positive outcome.\nIf your pet is facing an emergency, you can come directly to our hospital – no appointment is needed. Our expert team is available for pet emergencies 24 hours a day, 365 days a year.\nMedVet New Orleans Caregivers\nSearch by Name\nFilter by Specialty\nAll Specialties\nCardiology\nDermatology\nEmergency Medicine\nIntegrative Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nMedical Oncology\nRadiology\nRehabilitation\nSurgery\nOur Hospital Leaders\nKatie Severson, DVM\nMedical Director\nKayla Edwards\nHospital Director\nOur Doctors\nRita Akers\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nElisabeth Alost\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nKenneth Arceneaux\n, DVM, DACVIM (SAIM)\nInternal Medicine\nShelby Bascle\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nAlicia Beets\n, DVM, Residency Trained in Internal Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nTwila Booke\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nKatie Como\n, DVM, MPH, DACVIM (SAIM)\nInternal Medicine\nRachel C. Cuccia\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nMarie Faucheux\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nBeth Favaloro\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nJulia Fincher\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nLindsey Foto\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nKristen Fulham\n, DVM, MS, DACVD®\nDermatology\nLindsey Harvey\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nMissy Jackson\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nKeith Jarrett\n, DVM, Limited to the Practice of Surgery\nSurgery\nDarin Kepler\n, DVM, MS, DACVR\nRadiology\nAriel Kilpatrick\n, DVM\nInternal Medicine\nPetra Koenig\n, BVM&S\nEmergency Medicine\nJennifer Lang\n, DVM, DACVS (Small Animal)\nSurgery\nJordan Lee\n, DVM, Limited to the Practice of Surgery\nSurgery\nStephen Lemarie\n, DVM, MS, DACVD®\nDermatology\nSarah Lyles\n, DVM, DACVIM (Oncology)\nMedical Oncology\nCody Mannino\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nBrigitte McAtee\n, DVM, DACVIM (SAIM)\nInternal Medicine\nBrittney McDonald\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nKeegan McElroy\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nAlison Mikes\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nNicholas Moraites\n, DVM, MPH\nRehabilitation\nAmber Moses\n, DVM, DACVIM (Oncology)\nMedical Oncology\nOlivia Oubre\n, DVM, CVA, CCRT\nEmergency Medicine, Integrative Medicine, Rehabilitation\nGarrett J. Smith\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nKayla Smith\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nDarius J. Statham\n, DVM\nSurgery\nJensen Turbeville\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nJorge Vilá\n, DVM, MS, DACVIM (Cardiology)\nCardiology\nShow All Doctors (\n36\n)\nPet Stories\n“\nOzzy and I are eternally grateful! We could never thank you enough for your warmth, understanding, generosity and excellent care. He made a quick and full recovery. I think he’s getting tired of me kissing him and hugging him all day. 😆Much love and blessings to each and every staff member! 😘 🙏”\nPrevious Story\nNext Story\nFinancing Options\nWe understand that planning for the cost of care is important. Special financing and payment arrangements are available for qualified pet owners through an independent company, CareCredit.\nLearn More\nFind a location\nEmergency Care\nFind Care\nFind a Location\nFind A Doctor\nResource