      "address": "2315 N. Causeway Blvd., Metairie, LA 70001",
      "description": "Comprehensive and Compassionate Care for New Orleans Pets Every Day of the Year  MedVet New Orleans is home to the most advanced 24-hour emergency, critical care, and specialty pet care in the area and is the only emergency animal hospital in New Orleans to offer internal medicine. Our comprehensive care is an extension of your family veterinarian. As part of our advanced veterinary care, we offer life-saving treatments for your pets. Serving thousands of patients a year, our team is a trusted partner in care for family veterinarians and pet lovers. We know pets are an important part of your family, and we strive to provide exceptional care while showing compassion for you and your pet. Our team has the expertise and the resources in our state-of-the-art facility to diagnose and treat your pet, giving them the best chance for a positive outcome.   If your pet is facing an emergency, you can come directly to our hospital – no appointment is needed. Our expert team is available for pet emergencies 24 hours a day, 365 days a year.  ",
